### Posts. Needs a signed-in user.
### Get a token by signing in (see auth.http) and paste its accessToken here:
@token = <paste accessToken>
@postId = <paste a post id>

### Delete a post -> 204. The author deletes it; a moderator of its niche or an admin removes it.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 404 POST_NOT_FOUND: run the delete again, or as a user who is not the author, a moderator or an admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 BAD_REQUEST: not a UUID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401 without a token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
